Please note that this implementation requires additional logic to check if a file is an EPUB file, validate metadata against a specified version, and check if the content is valid. You will need to implement these methods according to your specific requirements.

Also, keep in mind that EPUB files are complex structures, and validating them completely can be challenging. This implementation provides a basic starting point, but you may need to add more complexity to cover all aspects of an EPUB file.
